msgstr ""

msgid "Game devices (PC, console). Give them static DHCP leases so the address does not change."
msgstr ""

msgid "Game server ports"
msgstr ""

msgid "UDP ports of the game servers. Defaults are Fortnite: 9000-9999 (match) and 15000-15999 (control)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Paired port range"
msgstr ""

msgid "When a connection to this range is seen, the paired match port is probed in advance. Empty disables it."
msgstr ""

msgid "Paired port offset"
msgstr ""

msgid "Offset from the control port to the match port (Fortnite: 15062 → 9062 = -6000)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Fallback echo port"
msgstr ""

msgid "Server UDP echo port used when the game port does not answer."
msgstr ""

msgid "Ports per probe round"
msgstr ""

msgid "Probed in parallel. More may trigger the server's rate limit."
msgstr ""

msgid "Probe rounds"
msgstr ""

msgid "Extra rounds when no port passes. Each round adds about 1.3 seconds to connecting."
msgstr ""

msgid "Reuse probe results (seconds)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Results drift after 10-20 minutes, keep this short."
msgstr ""

